Prebuilt fonts
==============

Fonts installed into the root filesystem for console/GUI rendering.

Prebuilt from Rockchip Buildroot 2021 SDK:
4e2f5a2c9ae gdb: Bump to buildroot upstream

Using rockchip_rk3588_defconfig with additional configs:
BR2_PACKAGE_FONTCONFIG=y
BR2_PACKAGE_DEJAVU=y
BR2_PACKAGE_LIBERATION=y
BR2_PACKAGE_SOURCE_HAN_SANS_CN=y
